{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;</i>Gunblade Ranger<i>&quot;\u00a0</i>is a post-apocalyptic roguelike top-down shooter. When nuclear fallout reduced civilization to ashes, survivors either rot in mutation or rise as purifiers. As a ranger, wield an energy-charged blade and switch between 30+ firearms\u2014from SMGs to radiation-pulse crossbows Hunt mutants in procedurally generated wastelands, and  harvest mutagens to unlock mutant abilities Storm the heart of the radiation source, where your final blade strike will decide humanity\u2019s fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slash Squad \u2014 8 warriors, unique weapons/skills, gear/mutation combos for custom builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wasteland Arsenal \u2014 30+ guns, 20+tactical, 50+mutations; fresh combat every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Radiation Zones \u2014 7 zones, hidden stages, rogram generated random map. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you survive the radiation tide, end the Storm, and reclaim humanity's future\uff1f</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3702140?t=1751100429","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702140/247217441a24c01862d5079b072573b12143185f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751100429","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702140/74bd23ac1b6e468911716e1e8bbb19755ffe2d0e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751100429","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702140/74bd23ac1b6e468911716e1e8bbb19755ffe2d0e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751100429","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":